	(text "Hiearchial sheets are used to keep ECAD clean, readable, and modular.\n\nEach \"sub-sheet\" represents a subystem or module within the system.\n- e.g. PowerCircuitry, SensorInterface, etc.\n\nConnections are made between subsystems through \"Hiearchial Labels\",\npress [H] in the sub-sheets to add them, and right click the sub-sheet\nin the root sheet to import hiearchial labels/sheet pins."
